error[SC0409]: this writes `q`, which another operand of the same expression writes too
   ╭─[ a_pointer_assigned_its_own_increment_is_reported.c:3:5 ]
   │
 3 │     q = q++;
   │     ┬   ─┬─  
   │     ╰──────── written here as well
   │          │   
   │          ╰─── written here
───╯
  = note: C17 6.5 p2 makes this undefined wherever both are evaluated: nothing orders an operator's operands against each other (6.5 p3)
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = help: assign it in a statement of its own before this expression
